--- !u!114 &1927774598
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1927774596}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7d20f73aabcb4cfbaac49363662be3e1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueController
  currentDialogueIndex: 0
  textStartOffset: 0
  dialogues:
  - texts:
    - Foul door! What manner of devilry is this?
    - No lock to pick... no combination to crack? And walls too smooth to climb!
    - No matter... Simply a worthy test of Benjamin's burgaling skills!
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - ...You're still here?
    - It's a little hard to concentrate with you breathing down my neck!
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - WHAT THE?
    - You -
    - The - !
    - You think you're slick? Keen on taking a piece of the pie that is Benjamin's
      burgeoning portfolio of burglaring accomplishments??
    - You will rue this day...
    - ...Wait a minute. What the heck IS that thing in there?
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - Holy mackerel. It's a Pneumatic!
    - I heard these babies let you zip across the mountatin in a jiffy. But I never
      thought I'd see one with my own eyes!
    - This discovery will make for an excellent chapter in my autobiography!
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - Don't think I've forgiven you for stealing the glory of cracking that door.
      I was about to get it open!
    - Fortunately for you, I just trimmed my claws. Next time you won't be so lucky...!
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  DialogueName: Benjamin
  LookAtOverride: {fileID: 0}
  CameraY: 0.55
  canvasDelay: 0
  cameraFollowOffsetLerp: 0
